    "name": "Refinitiv Qual-ID Verification API",
    "description": "RESTful API for automating identity verification and document verification processes. It helps organizations comply with regulations and identify potential financial crime using trusted and vetted data sources with normalized data fields. Supports verification across multiple countries using local data sources for identity matching.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: LSEG Developer Support",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-21T20:34:54.000Z",
